# The canonical vault save engine must stay LF in the working tree.
#
# These files are imported directly by the test suite. Under core.autocrlf they
# check out as CRLF, and a CRLF shebang line breaks Vite's module transform —
# the suite fails to load on any Windows checkout while passing on the author's
# machine, because freshly written files have not yet round-tripped through git.
src/main/vault-save/*.mjs text eol=lf
